<h2>Asobi 0.2 (build 255)</h2>
<p><b>Groundwork for Web Review</b> — the browser seat for clients who can't install anything.</p>
<ul>
<li>Shared-review sessions now have a <b>mailbox</b>: comments left in a review while the host is offline (the upcoming web client's async mode) are collected automatically the next time the host opens the session.</li>
<li>Notes carry their identity across the wire now, so a comment can never be ingested twice — however many paths it arrives by.</li>
<li>No action needed; fully compatible with earlier builds in the same session.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
